        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>2024 · 美的集团ESG报告 — 践行科技尽善</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']]},\n  svg: {fontCache: 'global'}\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", sans-serif;\n    color: #231f20;\n  }\n  .spread {\n    display: flex;\n    width: 2340px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 1170px;\n    position: relative;\n    padding: 60px 100px 60px 110px;\n    min-height: 1640px;\n  }\n  /* ---------- header ---------- */\n  .hdr {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    letter-spacing: .5px;\n    color: #4a4a55;\n    height: 40px;\n  }\n  .hdr-left { color: #3b3b45; }\n  .hdr-nav {\n    margin-left: auto;\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 26px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .hdr-nav span { white-space: nowrap; }\n  .hdr-nav .active {\n    color: #7b3fa0;\n    border: 1.5px solid #7b3fa0;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 4px 14px;\n  }\n  .page.right .hdr { justify-content: flex-end; }\n  /* ---------- section band ---------- */\n  .band {\n    margin-top: 110px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: stretch;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg,#efe7f7 0%, #f5f1fa 60%, #faf8fc 100%);\n    border-radius: 34px;\n    height: 66px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .band .icon {\n    width: 96px;\n    background: #7b3fa0;\n    border-radius: 34px 22px 22px 34px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .band .icon i {\n    display: block;\n    width: 44px;\n  }\n  .band .icon i span {\n    display: block;\n    height: 4px;\n    background: #fff;\n    margin: 6px 0 6px 12px;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n  }\n  .band .icon i span:before {\n    content: '';\n    display: block;\n    width: 4px; height: 4px;\n    background: #fff;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    margin-left: -12px;\n    position: relative;\n    top: 0;\n  }\n  .band .btitle {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding-left: 40px;\n    font-size: 24px;\n    color: #7b3fa0;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  /* ---------- content card ---------- */\n  .card {\n    background: #f7f7f8;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    padding: 34px 40px 46px 40px;\n    margin-top: 22px;\n  }\n  .tag {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background: #efe7f7;\n    color: #6a3b8f;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    padding: 9px 20px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    letter-spacing: .5px;\n  }\n  .para {\n    font-size: 19px;\n    line-height: 2.05;\n    margin: 26px 4px 0 4px;\n    text-align: justify;\n    color: #2b2b30;\n  }\n  .caption {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    color: #2b2b30;\n    margin-top: 18px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 12px;\n  }\n  .caption:before {\n    content: '';\n    width: 9px; height: 9px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #7b3fa0;\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .caption.center { justify-content: center; }\n  /* ---------- placeholders ---------- */\n  .placeholder {\n    background: #e8e8ec;\n    border: 1px dashed #b9b9c4;\n    color: #6c6c78;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 6px;\n  }\n  /* ---------- two column inner ---------- */\n  .two-col {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 56px;\n    margin-top: 56px;\n  }\n  .two-col > div { flex: 1; }\n  .imgrow {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 20px;\n    margin-top: 30px;\n  }\n  .cap-row {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 20px;\n    margin-top: 16px;\n  }\n  .cap-row .caption { flex: 1; margin-top: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55; }\n  /* ---------- right page specifics ---------- */\n  .flexblock {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 40px;\n    margin-top: 60px;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .footnote {\n    margin-top: 60px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    color: #3a3a42;\n  }\n  .footnote hr {\n    border: none;\n    border-top: 2px solid #7b3fa0;\n    width: 180px;\n    margin: 0 0 14px 0;\n  }\n  .pgnum {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 40px;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    color: #55555f;\n  }\n  .page.left .pgnum { left: 110px; }\n  .page.right .pgnum { right: 100px; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"spread\">\n\n  <!-- ================= LEFT PAGE (91) ================= -->\n  <div class=\"page left\">\n    <div class=\"hdr\">\n      <div class=\"hdr-left\">2024 · 美的集团ESG报告</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"band\">\n      <div class=\"icon\"><i><span></span><span></span><span></span></i></div>\n      <div class=\"btitle\">品质属性</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"tag\">耐用性提升：美的COLMO电热水器</div>\n      <p class=\"para\">该产品创新性将高分子材料应用于热水器的内胆中，并搭载Ti钛金抗腐层，其内胆脉冲寿命为传统搪瓷内胆的40倍，耐腐蚀性能比上一代产品提高一倍以上。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:100%;height:430px;margin-top:28px;\">\n        [Photo: COLMO EVOLUTION 云墅电热水器BJ5 产品图 + 技术对比图示（1.0时代 搪瓷内胆 / 2.0时代 玻璃纤维内胆 / 3.0时代 铂钻鲜水舱），居中通栏]\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">美的COLMO电热水器</div>\n\n      <div class=\"two-col\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"tag\">耐候性提升：石墨烯涂层空调</div>\n          <p class=\"para\">该产品使用长效防腐耐候石墨烯涂层，使铝箔耐中性盐雾时长延长至300%，热扩散系数提升31%，耐候性提升4倍，获得Intertek长效防腐最高等级认定和国际顶刊《Nature》专题报道。</p>\n          <div class=\"imgrow\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:33%;height:210px;\">[Document: Intertek Test Verification of Conformity 证书]</div>\n            <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:33%;height:210px;\">[Photo: 《Nature》专题报道页面 — MAKING LEAPS TOWARDS SUSTAINABLE AIR CONDITIONING]</div>\n            <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:33%;height:210px;\">[Photo: 期刊内页照片]</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"cap-row\">\n            <div class=\"caption\">Intertek长效<br>防腐最高等级认定</div>\n            <div class=\"caption\">《Nature》专题报道</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"tag\">智能设计：美的COLMO射频嵌入式蒸汽烤箱</div>\n          <p class=\"para\">该产品应用前沿的固态射频微波技术并结合先进的模式识别叠加算法，实现微波精准定向输出，使加热均匀性提升50%。</p>\n          <div class=\"imgrow\" style=\"margin-top:110px;\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:48%;height:210px;\">[Photo: 美的COLMO射频嵌入式蒸汽烤箱]</div>\n            <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:48%;height:210px;\">[Document: 科学技术成果鉴定证书]</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"cap-row\">\n            <div class=\"caption\">美的COLMO射频<br>嵌入式蒸汽烤箱</div>\n            <div class=\"caption\">科学技术成果<br>鉴定证书</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pgnum\">91</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ================= RIGHT PAGE (92) ================= -->\n  <div class=\"page right\">\n    <div class=\"hdr\">\n      <div class=\"hdr-nav\">\n        <span>关于本报告</span>\n        <span>走进美的</span>\n        <span>可持续发展治理</span>\n        <span>守护蓝色星球</span>\n        <span>构建和谐社区</span>\n        <span class=\"active\">践行科技尽善</span>\n        <span>共创繁荣生态</span>\n        <span>附录</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"band\">\n      <div class=\"icon\"><i><span></span><span></span><span></span></i></div>\n      <div class=\"btitle\">环境属性</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"tag\">降低污染物排放：美的滚筒系列洗衣机</div>\n      <p class=\"para\">该系列产品应用全球首创的超微净泡及蓝氧技术，实现洗涤剂用量减少50%，能够有效降低洗涤剂造成的水足迹<sup>6</sup>。该系列产品已获得中国轻工业联合会科技进步奖、年度艾普兰优秀产品奖、革新产品金选奖、健康洗护之星等众多荣誉。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:100%;height:290px;margin-top:36px;background:#efefef;\">\n        [Photo: 美的滚筒系列洗衣机产品阵列，居中通栏]\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">美的滚筒系列洗衣机</div>\n\n      <div class=\"flexblock\">\n        <div style=\"flex:1;\">\n          <div class=\"tag\">减少毒害物质产生：美的缤色系列集成灶SP3</div>\n          <p class=\"para\" style=\"margin-top:60px;\">该系列产品采用可换向直排风道和多重油烟分离净烟设计，实现油烟PM2.5低至32μg/m³，获得一级净烟认证。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"flex:0 0 300px;\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:300px;height:380px;\">\n            [Poster: 美的缤色系列集成灶SP3 — 荣获\"一级净烟\"认证 宣传图，右侧]\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"caption\" style=\"justify-content:center;\">美的缤色系列集成灶SP3</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"footnote\">\n      <hr>\n      <sup>6</sup> 根据评估，应用超微净泡及蓝氧技术的已出售洗衣机产品每年可有效降低洗涤剂造成的水可用性足迹5.76百万 m³depriv.、水酸化足迹258075mol H+eq、淡水富营养化足迹11.84tPeq、海水富营养化足迹183.15tNeq、淡水生态毒性足迹1.39亿CTUe。\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pgnum\">92</div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
